[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7142.589, "timestamp": "01:59:02", "text": "現在情況不同了。阿久先生的加入帶來了巨大的改變。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7143.31, "timestamp": "01:59:03", "text": "太瘋狂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7144.87, "timestamp": "01:59:04", "text": "它確實能讓你感覺身材更緊緻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7146.069, "timestamp": "01:59:06", "text": "那不對，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7192.95, "timestamp": "01:59:52", "text": "哦，我們的迫擊砲基地被摧毀了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7194.35, "timestamp": "01:59:54", "text": "那裡肯定有什麼東西。"}]